WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.461
Here's how to turn your chess book into one you can play through, move by move.

00:00:04.911 --> 00:00:06.249
Open the menu,

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:08.249
and go to Books.

00:00:08.911 --> 00:00:13.108
Tap Upload a PDF, and pick your chess book. Scanned books work too.

00:00:13.558 --> 00:00:20.485
Chess Preparatory reads it page by page. A scanned book takes a few minutes, and we can email you when it's done.

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:22.742
When it's ready, tap Read.

00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:26.066
Every move in the book is highlighted. Tap one,

00:00:26.516 --> 00:00:32.697
and the position opens on a board. Step forwards and backwards through the line, right beside the page.

00:00:33.147 --> 00:00:37.472
Your book stays on your device. Try it at chesspreparatory.com.
